# FinTrack - Personal Finance Manager

A full-stack personal finance management application.

## Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- CSS
- Recharts

### Backend
- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Security
- JWT
- Spring Data JPA
- MySQL

## Features

- User registration and login
- JWT authentication
- Add income and expenses
- Edit/delete transactions
- Monthly budget
- Dashboard
- Reports and charts
- CSV export

